{"title": "Consumed Shadow Weave", "pageid": 32770, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Consumed_Shadow_Weave", "categories": ["Bugs", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Consumed Shadow Weave</b> is a passive feature unique to <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a> Origin that grants him a <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Shadow_Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Shadow_Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Shadow_Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Shadow_Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/98/Shadow_Spell_Slot_Icon.png/40px-Shadow_Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/98/Shadow_Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Shadow_Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/98/Shadow_Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Permanent_bonuses#Consumed_Shadow_Weave\" title=\"Permanent bonuses\">Level 3 Shadow Spell Slot</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Gale has gained a level 3 <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Slot\">spell slot</a>. It restores on a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Consume the Shadow Weave from the corpse of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gerringothe Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/24/Portrait_Gerringothe_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gerringothe_Thorm\" title=\"Gerringothe Thorm\">Gerringothe Thorm</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Malus Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Portrait_Malus_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Malus_Thorm\" title=\"Malus Thorm\">Malus Thorm</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thisobald_Thorm\" title=\"Thisobald Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thisobald Thorm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3e/Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3e/Portrait_Thisobald_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thisobald_Thorm\" title=\"Thisobald Thorm\">Thisobald Thorm</a> after slaying them in combat</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Gale cannot use Consume the Shadow Weave if he has not <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Wizard_of_Waterdeep\" title=\"The Wizard of Waterdeep\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"stabilized\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/The_Wizard_of_Waterdeep\" title=\"The Wizard of Waterdeep\">stabilized</a> the <a href=\"/wiki/Netheril#Netherese_orb\" title=\"Netheril\">Netherese Orb</a>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The granted Level 3 Shadow Spell Slot is not reset when consuming a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/62/POT_Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Angelic_Slumber\" title=\"Potion of Angelic Slumber\">Potion of Angelic Slumber</a> nor when affected by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Divine_Intervention:_Opulent_Revival\" title=\"Divine Intervention: Opulent Revival\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp/30px-Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp/40px-Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Divine Intervention: Opulent Revival\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f9/Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp/20px-Divine_Intervention_Opulent_Revival_Icon.webp\" d